{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Into the Puzzleverse</strong> is Score Studios's follow-up to the acclaimed <strong>Piczle Lines DX</strong>. This content pack takes all the puzzles from this game's story mode and makes them available to play for the very first time on PC in <strong>Piczle World of Puzzles</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128620/extras/d0f68bb1196a462edd257701fceb8f3c.avif?t=1761862596\" width=1000 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 200 Piczle Lines puzzles that formed the 8 themed story mode chapters, as well as the 10 huge puzzles from the game's hidden chapter, <i>and</i> the 16 puzzles from the demo version of the game, for a total of a whopping <strong>226</strong> Piczle Lines puzzles to keep you occupied for countless hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128620/extras/919dc3a79aeb862ca3964f0b0d1553fd.avif?t=1761862596\" width=996 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your profile with a brand new set of avatars  based on Score-chan's various guises in the Puzzleverse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note:\u00a0</strong>This DLC <u>only</u> contains the puzzles from the story mode of Into the Puzzleverse. For the full story-driven experience and 3D dioramas please play the original game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128620?t=1761862596","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128620?t=1761862596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128620/ed89a828f68